name Will-o'-wisp
recipe tier=1 secret=1 X1p0 Y2p0
bench 1
root 65.4064
bind score.will_o_wisp spell blend 0.4 1
layer bed pyretic/pyretic_synth_00001_loop 7 0.0000 1001 level=0.15000 attack=0.30000 release=0.60000 pitch=-5.17941 cutoff=1.00000 echo=0.00000 reverb=0.00000 drive=0.00000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=1.00000 keyed=1 file=pyretic/pyretic_synth_00001_loop.ogg
layer cloud cloud 0 0.0000 1005 level=0.50000 attack=0.60000 release=1.00000 pitch=15.00000 cutoff=0.70000 reverb=0.80000 voices=8.00000 gather=1.00000 drift=0.35000 timbre=0.30000 chord=5.00000 sub=0.00000 keyed=1
layer fire pyretic/fire_loop 5 0.0000 1006 level=0.05000 attack=0.30000 release=0.60000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.40000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=pyretic/fire_loop.ogg
bind orb.radius cloud level 0.38 0.55
note Will-o'-wisp (tier I, secret): X n1 p0 . Y n2 p0: both arms on the root, so the colour is all the cloud's: a minor chord an octave
note higher (C4), soft, drenched, swelling with the orb's reach. Almost no fire. Creeps in from score 0.4. No one-shot.
